天啊 我堕落得太快太深了
Oh God, I'm falling so far so fast.

7
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,100
没有这么夸张啦
You haven't fallen that far.

8
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,780
第一件是 发束
First item, a scrunchie

9
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:19,720
我需要这个 给我
I need that! Give me!

10
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,540
我堕落到极限 该停了
I think I hit my bottom.

11
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,200
好了 下一件
Okay, next item.

12
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,520
验孕棒
A pregnancy test.

13
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:27,520
那盒子是空的
That's empty.

14
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,680
看我干嘛 我有两分钟空档
What? I had two free minutes,

15
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:30,560
有孕验孕 没孕强身嘛
and you never know.

16
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:34,140
能不能快点
Can we move this along?

17
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,300
我年纪大了 得早点上床
I'm an old man, and I need to get to bed.

18
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,540
你是约了妹子"上床" 现在迟到了吧
You are late to meet woman for hot date.

19
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,480
还是你懂行
You know it.

20
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,280
一个钱包
A wallet and...

21
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,160
可惜没钱
no money.

22
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,220
看我干嘛 如果我怀孕了
What? If I was pregnant,

23
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,580
我得花钱去打孩子啊
I needed it for the baby.

24
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:58,420
最后一样 是连续六个月都有的
And finally for the sixth month in a row...

25
00:00:58,820 --> 00:00:59,340
假发
The wig.

26
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,120
假发
The wig!

27
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:04,660
阿憨 这次该你了
Han, it's your turn.

28
00:01:04,740 --> 00:01:06,240
除了你 我们都戴过了
We have all put it on except you.

29
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:08,200
连我都戴过这玩意拍照了
If I had to take a picture in it,

30
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:09,840
你也得做同样的事情
you have to take a picture in it.

31
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:11,260
好吧
Okay, fine.

32
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,500
我可真是个风趣的老板啊
Man, I'm a fun boss.

33
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,600
不好意思 先生 我们打烊了
Oh, sorry, sir. We're closed.

34
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:25,740
我来看看是不是把假发忘在这了
I was just checking if I left my toupee here.

35
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:27,140
快点拍照
Take the picture quick.

36
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,800
我拿到了 拿到了
I got it. Here it is.

37
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,920
最新一期《玛莎生活杂志》
The new Martha Stewart Living.

38
00:01:49,260 --> 00:01:50,980
我跑得超快 那个图书管理员说
I ran so fast, the librarian said,

39
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,680
"不许在图书馆乱跑" 我差点就回他
"Stop running in the library," and I almost said,

40
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,860
"我不是跑着玩 我是偷书"
"This is different. I'm stealing."

41
00:01:55,180 --> 00:01:56,538
你为什么还每个月
Why are you still even looking

42
00:01:56,538 --> 00:01:58,334
都看这本破杂志啊
through Martha Stewart living every month?

43
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,580
因为她可能会在里面提到我们啊
'Cause we might be mentioned in it.

44
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,400
玛莎说她没有忘记我们
Martha said she hadn't forgotten about us.

45
00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:02,780
我妈当年也是这么说的
That's what my mother said,

46
00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:04,020
最后老娘落得了在学校停车场
but I spent a whole day and night

47
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:05,280
等了整整一天一夜的下场
in that school parking lot.

48
00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:06,740
不幸中的大幸是
Silver lining-

49
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:09,460
我现在还会唱TLC乐队那首《瀑布》的说唱部分
I still know the whole rap part to TLC's Waterfalls.

50
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,520
我还抱着我们会在书中出现的希望
Well, I'm still holding out hope we're in this,

51
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:14,300
虽然我已经连续两个月被伤透了心
even though I've been hurt two months in a row.

52
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:16,660
天啊 我是不是跟一个指点生活的专家
Oh, god, am I in an abusive relationship

53
00:02:16,660 --> 00:02:17,740
在谈一场虐恋啊
with a lifestyle guru?

54
00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:21,560
好吧 我们快快过一遍
Okay, let's get this over with.

55
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:23,600
"如何让他爱上你做的鲑鱼"
"How to make him love your salmon."

56
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:25,560
"如果让他爱上你的妊娠纹"
"How to make him love your stretch marks."

57
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:26,840
拜托 他就是不爱你嘛
Hey, he just doesn't love you.

58
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,940
全是达能酸奶广告 广告 广告
Activia ad, activia ad, activia ad.

59
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:30,820
我们知道啦 杰米·李
We get it, Jamie Lee.

60
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,600
你消化好排便畅
You poop lot.

61
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:34,440
"让你的烤箱有如大师般洁净"
"Get your oven Martha-clean,"

62
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:35,680
"麦克斯的什么小蛋糕"
"Max's something cupcakes"

63
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,740
桌布 桌布 桌布
Scarf, scarf, scarf.

64
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,140
慢着 麦克斯的小蛋糕
Wait, Max's cupcakes?

65
00:02:38,580 --> 00:02:40,540
你刚是说"麦克斯的什么小蛋糕"吗
You just said, "Max's something cupcakes."

66
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:41,340
是吗
I did?

67
00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:43,640
我的耳朵还真不习惯
Wow, my ears are so not used

68
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,060
听进我嘴里说出来的好话
to anything good coming out of my mouth.

69
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:46,840
这里这里 你看
There. There. Look.

70
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,640
"麦克斯自制小蛋糕
"Max's homemade cupcakes

71
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,660
是威廉斯堡必尝好滋味"
is a Williamsburg must-have."

72
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:53,500
这是什么 我的脸在干嘛
What's this? What's my face doing?

73
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,260
-你在笑啊 麦克斯 -不可能
- You're smiling, Max. - No way!

74
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,100
天啊 天啊 这是商品宣传
Oh, my God. Oh, my God. It's a blurb.

75
00:02:58,300 --> 00:03:00,480
各位 《玛莎生活杂志》在帮我们做宣传
Everyone, we got a blurb In Martha Stewart Living.

76
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,960
能再给我来杯咖啡吗
Can I get some more coffee?

77
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,580
你疯啦
Are you insane?

78
00:03:04,192 --> 00:03:05,777
大家好啊
Hey, everyone.

79
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,720
干嘛这么激动
What's the excitement?

80
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,440
是因为我来了吗
Is it 'cause I'm here?

81
00:03:10,780 --> 00:03:12,600
苏菲 快看 《玛莎生活杂志》
Sophie, look, Max's homemade cupcakes

82
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,460
在帮"麦克斯自制小蛋糕"做宣传哦
got a blurb in Martha Stewart Living.

83
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:16,240
真有意思
Oh, that's funny,

84
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:20,140
因为《纽约公寓杂志》也在帮我做宣传
'cause I got a blurb in New York Apartment Life.

85
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:24,440
瞧 "苏菲的选择清洁公司
Look. "Sophie's choice cleaning service--

86
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:27,260
她们为了生活做牛做马 流血流汗"
they clean like their life depends on it."

87
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:31,180
那跟这个不一样啦
Well, that's not exactly the same.

88
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:34,880
当然不一样 瞧 我得到三个皮搋子
No, 'cause, look, I got three plungers.

89
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,360
没错 我本来不想吹嘘的啦
Yeah, but I didn't want to brag.

90
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:41,320
一定是安迪问我
That must be andy wondering

91
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,840
晚上要不要过去滚床单
if I'm coming over to have sex tonight.

92
00:03:43,060 --> 00:03:44,380
我的人生还能再美好点吗
Could my life get any better?

93
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:48,000
天啊 还真能
Oh, my God. It could get better.

94
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:50,180
我们有十个蛋糕订单
There are, like, ten cupcake orders here.

95
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:51,780
生日派对 新生儿派对 割礼
Birthday, baby shower, bris.

96
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,320
我们可以接割礼吗
Can we do a bris?

97
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:55,140
当然 我做点玫瑰造型的包皮
Sure. I'll just make a little rosette foreskin

98
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,740
然后在外面写上
and write around the outside,

99
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:59,540
"恭喜你 20年后不会吓着女人了"
"Congratulations on not terrifying women in 20 years."

100
