你好 安迪
Hey, Andy.

101
00:04:04,540 --> 00:04:05,160
你好 糖果
Hi, candy.

102
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:07,580
你看到了吗
Did you see it?

103
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,980
你看了新一期的《玛莎生活杂志》了吗
Did you see the new Martha Stewart Living?

104
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:10,440
抱歉 没有
Oh, sorry, no.

105
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:12,260
我还没看完本期《魅力》跟《新娘》女性杂志呢
I still have to get through my Glamour and Modern Bride.

106
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:15,120
我有姐姐 所以知道那些杂志名不为过
And I had sisters, so I'm allowed to know those names.

107
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:18,120
"威廉斯堡必尝好滋味" 不错啊
"A Williamsburg must-have." Nice.

108
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,600
我一直觉得你也是
You know I feel the same way about you.

109
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:21,940
真会说话 不过除非上了报章杂志
Aw, cute, but it really doesn't mean anything

110
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:22,860
不然不算数
unless it's in a blurb.

111
00:04:24,300 --> 00:04:26,060
我都等不及要拿给你看呢
I couldn't wait to show this to you.

112
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:27,920
真庆幸你还在这里加班整理存货
I'm so glad you were here late doing inventory.

113
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:29,800
是啊 说来也怪
Yeah, you know, it's the weirdest thing.

114
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,380
我唯一不知道去哪里的就是
The only thing I can't account for

115
00:04:31,380 --> 00:04:33,560
一个猫王的糖果盒 麦克斯
is one missing Elvis Pez dispenser, Max.

116
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:37,300
我不知道你在说什么 但...
Um, I don't know what you're talking about, but...

117
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:39,020
非常感谢
Thank you very much.

118
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,640
我们能回到宣传这个话题吗
Can we please get back to the blurb?

119
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:42,880
抱歉 你说得对
Sorry. You're right.

120
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,240
我应该更重视这件事
I should have made a bigger deal about it.

121
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:46,080
只是我有点被吓到了
It's just I've been a little freaked out.

122
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:47,420
这里今天发生了件大事
We had some big drama here today.

123
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,100
小糖果屋能发生什么"大事"
Drama in a candy store?

124
00:04:49,340 --> 00:04:51,480
是不是被酸奶裹着的葡萄干终于意识到
Did the yogurt-covered craisins finally realize

125
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,240
自己是多么愚蠢 然后集体自杀了
how stupid they are and commit mass suicide?

126
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:56,180
不 不过说真的
No, but seriously they pulled some bodies

127
00:04:56,180 --> 00:04:58,200
今晚他们从对面的施粥坊运出几具尸体
out of the closed-down soup kitchen across the way tonight.

128
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:00,500
所以现在完全不聊宣传这事了吗
So now we're completely off the blurb?

129
00:05:02,140 --> 00:05:03,300
有些不明人士闯进去
Some guys broke in.

130
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,320
然后一堆人被乱枪打死
A bunch of people got shot.

131
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,180
显然是毒品交易谈不拢
Apparently, it was a drug deal gone wrong.

132
00:05:06,460 --> 00:05:08,760
-天啊 太可怕了 -就是啊
- Oh, my God. That's horrible. - I know.

133
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:10,560
为什么毒品交易总是谈不拢呢
Why can't a drug deal ever go right?

134
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:14,160
听人说当时血肉横飞啊
Hey, they said it was a real bloodbath.

135
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:15,460
我要去看
I want to see it!

136
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,140
好吧 我得合上杂志了是吗
Oh, okay, so I'm closing the magazine then?

137
00:05:21,940 --> 00:05:22,980
麦克斯 你不能进去
Max, you can't go in there.

138
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,500
那可是犯罪现场 有警察封锁带
It's a crime scene. There's police tape.

139
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,400
她会魔术吗
Is she magic?

140
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:33,440
我妈有个男友过去专门偷电子商店
One of my mom's boyfriends used to rob electronic stores.

141
00:05:33,580 --> 00:05:34,740
有次作为生日礼物 他带了我去
He took me once for my birthday.

142
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:40,540
这附近应该有灯的开关啊
Hmm, there should be a light switch around here.

143
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:44,080
-天啊 -这太恶心了吧
- Oh, my God. - Oh, that's really gross.

144
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:45,780
这是我见过最棒的东西
That's the greatest thing I've ever seen!

145
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:49,460
帮我在这里拍张照片
Take a picture of me over here.

146
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:52,180
我终于有理由加入网上照片分享的行列了
I finally have a reason to join Instagram.

147
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,920
人们浏览照片时肯定会这样 "食物 食物
People are gonna be like, "Food, food,

148
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:59,040
猫 食物 指甲 指甲 谋杀啊"
cat, food, nails, nails, murder?"

149
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:03,060
伙计们 我得走了
Guys, I can't be in here.

150
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:05,340
我吃饭有肉汁都想吐了 更何况这个
I get queasy if the meat juice touches my peas.

151
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,860
这是你第一次见到血溅一墙吗
Is this your first blood splatter?

152
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,280
真是个温室花朵小公主啊
Jeez, someone's a princess.

153
00:06:10,780 --> 00:06:13,100
天啊 这地方以后肯定没人敢租了
Man, they are never gonna be able to rent this place now.

154
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:15,360
我要回店里 往墙上浇点血
I'm gonna go over to my store and put blood on the walls

155
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,440
好讨麦克斯欢心
so Max will like it more.

156
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:20,300
麦克斯 看看四周
Max, look around.

157
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,740
你想的跟我的一样吗
Are you thinking what I'm thinking?

158
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:23,700
对 枪手站在这里
Yup. The shooter stood here,

159
00:06:23,700 --> 00:06:24,680
依墙上溅开的血迹分析
and, based on the blood splatter,

160
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:25,980
他个子不高 走路会一瘸一拐
he was short and walked with a limp.

161
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,840
他名叫迈德·道格[疯狗]
And his name was Mad Dog.

162
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:30,200
因为我希望他叫这个
'Cause I want that to be his name.

163
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:32,140
不 麦克斯
No, Max,

164
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:34,160
我们不是一直想拥有自己的店面吗
you know how we've always wanted our own shop?

165
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,640
就是这里了
This is it.

166
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,840
这里就是麦克斯自制小蛋糕的店址
This is Max's homemade cupcakes.

167
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:40,620
好吧 我懂了
Oh. Yeah, I see that.

168
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,360
还可以把我们的红色天鹅绒
And we can put our red velvets over there

169
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,860
摆那边的头骨碎渣旁
by the random skull fragments.

170
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,820
再说了 我们不是要把店开在曼哈顿吗
Besides, I thought our shop was gonna be in Manhattan.

171
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:49,100
曼哈顿已经落伍了
Manhattan's over.

172
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:51,280
现在威廉斯堡才是新的流行地
Williamsburg is the new hot area,

